    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/9f934b02a9047dd8fbcf4a45ef0014ac.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=640 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/9f934b02a9047dd8fbcf4a45ef0014ac.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Legend has it that there exists the Ten Thousand Realms Gate, which is a magical gateway to countless spatial worlds. These worlds are different, some are full of beauty and mystery, some are full of danger, some have endless wealth, and some contain powerful energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/7b8784eed2a6ec4faa821c1cb53e12f6.avif?t=1740582229\" width=640 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/df33ccce7aa0f120d2a135ea26a40bef.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using a portal generator to generate portals, you can create your own unique store.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enrich the store's portal card pool with portal props and gift packages, and create your own unique store card pool.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/0c8726173d8e17570c22debbb75292f8.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=331 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/0c8726173d8e17570c22debbb75292f8.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/b5a0626c523fa24b66b204ae109bdd63.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the gold coin upper limit lock and accumulate a huge amount of wealth.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refreshing the store is very enjoyable, but please note that each refresh will double the required coins!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/4b7c28a5765478e77b4e01cad1d20c13.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=311 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/4b7c28a5765478e77b4e01cad1d20c13.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/1e27018e92ba1ad36ce0ac7e0c8e8dfd.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The backpack is fully integrated with the system interface, featuring a novel spatial layout.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rotation of the indicator circles on both sides represents a switch in the world.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that time keeps passing in the battlefield world!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/fffd32d25eeded720b2db89331aded27.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=311 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/fffd32d25eeded720b2db89331aded27.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/4b943297a269db9cae63c385405ca11d.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware that enemies will become increasingly powerful as their world level increases!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/d98f5f576e0dfecacec7a01058d00538.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=331 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/d98f5f576e0dfecacec7a01058d00538.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/e7ce2357d2c8cd472f6058cc5b0a6ed1.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=640 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/e7ce2357d2c8cd472f6058cc5b0a6ed1.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/9f934b02a9047dd8fbcf4a45ef0014ac.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=640 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/9f934b02a9047dd8fbcf4a45ef0014ac.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Legend has it that there exists the Ten Thousand Realms Gate, which is a magical gateway to countless spatial worlds. These worlds are different, some are full of beauty and mystery, some are full of danger, some have endless wealth, and some contain powerful energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/7b8784eed2a6ec4faa821c1cb53e12f6.avif?t=1740582229\" width=640 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/df33ccce7aa0f120d2a135ea26a40bef.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using a portal generator to generate portals, you can create your own unique store.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enrich the store's portal card pool with portal props and gift packages, and create your own unique store card pool.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/0c8726173d8e17570c22debbb75292f8.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=331 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/0c8726173d8e17570c22debbb75292f8.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/b5a0626c523fa24b66b204ae109bdd63.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the gold coin upper limit lock and accumulate a huge amount of wealth.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refreshing the store is very enjoyable, but please note that each refresh will double the required coins!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/4b7c28a5765478e77b4e01cad1d20c13.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=311 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/4b7c28a5765478e77b4e01cad1d20c13.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/1e27018e92ba1ad36ce0ac7e0c8e8dfd.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The backpack is fully integrated with the system interface, featuring a novel spatial layout.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rotation of the indicator circles on both sides represents a switch in the world.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that time keeps passing in the battlefield world!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/fffd32d25eeded720b2db89331aded27.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=311 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/fffd32d25eeded720b2db89331aded27.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/4b943297a269db9cae63c385405ca11d.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware that enemies will become increasingly powerful as their world level increases!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/d98f5f576e0dfecacec7a01058d00538.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=500 height=331 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/d98f5f576e0dfecacec7a01058d00538.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/e7ce2357d2c8cd472f6058cc5b0a6ed1.poster.avif?t=1740582229\" width=640 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157870/extras/e7ce2357d2c8cd472f6058cc5b0a6ed1.webm?t=1740582229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
